":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1635437710.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z3v/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"992dcec5-74ea-4aa2-8834-f509d4c02571","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"非公式なのでやる時は予告なしでいきなり変わる可能性があります","ts":"1635437674.005300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9rBrn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b541797f-e00c-4fd6-b0e2-0cad963acdda","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それは使用を勧めるわけにはいかないか","ts":"1635437673.005200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2+is"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3b58869-2737-4eb9-bb78-713ecf67c8fa","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちなみにこれイケてないのでたぶん将来的に非互換の挙動変更入れると思う…デバッグ中に使うのはいいけどそれ以外で勝手に使っても責任は取れない","ts":"1635437642.004500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"etE5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"922a2942-696a-48f0-9749-5f3762ece02a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど","ts":"1635437616.003900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DPtE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c31f01fe-a167-499b-bd8c-d288484c26b8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"非公式だけど themis#log() はある","ts":"1635437597.003400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hOD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12b4b97e-98ed-4941-a8ef-6dbfb21230ee","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そもそもthemisのログに何か出力する方法あるんでしたっけ","ts":"1635437557.003000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mxtJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f775e81-c0da-44ac-a706-1f668edf8b92","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`:mes` の中身を取る方法はいくらでもあるのでそれは置いとくとして","ts":"1635437447.002600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SyT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41c9eefc-897f-4161-ad91-eaa528396512","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"微妙だとは思う","ts":"1635437275.002200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lYDty"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95ec79cc-5787-4b47-9daa-40be055f844a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とりあえずissueの例に対してはレジスタを使うべきではないとか思うけど提案そのものに対しては何とも言えないな","ts":"1635437272.002000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kr8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3dc022a-1c97-412f-8925-52a36783628e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なんなら直接コメント書いてくれてもいいのよ","ts":"1635437007.001300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab8b17f0-a62b-44d8-a6c3-836170175e59","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"うーーーん…微妙な気がしているのだけど、themis.vim を使っている方、意見をください…\n\u003chttps://github.com/thinca/vim-themis/issues/71\u003e","ts":"1635436914.000900","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/thinca/vim-themis/issues/71|#71 Include :messages in failure output\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/thinca/vim-themis/issues/71|#71 Include :messages in failure output\u003e","text":"*Is your feature request related to a problem?*\n\nOne of my tests is failing. The function reports possible problems using a logger that basically does `echomsg`. I would like to see those log statements to troubleshoot the test, but the `themis` command just reports that my function returned an empty list instead of my expected value.\n\n*Describe the solution you'd like*\n\nIt would be nice if there was an option to include the output of `:messages` (with the exception of the `Maintainer` line at the beginning) along with the assertion errors in the reporter output for failing tests.\n\nThis could be accomplished with something like calling `messages clear` before each test, then capturing messages after the test with\n\n```\nlet save_reg = getreg('m')\nredir @m\nsilent messages\nredir END\ncall setreg('m', save_reg)\n```","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"enhancement","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/thinca/vim-themis|thinca/vim-themis\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1635402354}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Bc2k"}]}]
